    "definitions": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "to put into song",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "その旅芸人は訪れた土地ごとの風景を歌い込んで新しい歌を作り、各地で披露して回った。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "作詞家は依頼主の思い出の場所を歌詞に歌い込み、結婚式用のオリジナルソングを仕上げた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "民謡師匠は地元の祭りの様子を丁寧に歌い込んで、後世に伝わる一曲を残した。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "gloss": "to sing (a song) many times",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "その曲は何度も歌い込むうちに体に馴染んで、楽譜を見なくても指が自然に動くようになった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "発表会まで一週間、彼女は同じ曲を毎日歌い込んで、細かい表現の揺れを整えていった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "ベテランの演歌歌手はこの曲を十年以上歌い込んでいるだけあって、どの音にも迷いがない。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            }
          ],
